# Level 25, reached by password GYLM, then the *other* heavy weapon collected
# from the south of the mall and fired at the boss.
#
# **What this is for is one ROM table the previous round did not read.**
# `movies/level25-boss.zmv` priced the boss kill off the four `$26` objects --
# weapon `$61`, five shots a pickup, twenty damage rewritten to four -- and got a
# ceiling of eighty against seventy health. Level 25's object list has two type
# `$22` objects as well, at (1046,1045) and (1110,1077). `$80:CA30` makes that id
# `$17`, `slot = id - $0C` makes it slot 11, and **`$80:F8AC` says slot 11 gives
# twenty shots a pickup** -- so forty shots at four damage each, a hundred and
# sixty, and `$67` is **not** one of the four ids `boss_9660_collide` rewrites.
# The kill stopped being ammunition-limited and became accuracy-limited.
#
# **Three things about the route.** The south of the mall is reached by an
# escalator and there are two of them side by side: down at x=917, up at x=945,
# eight pixels apart and one-way each. `zamn_assets route` treats both as
# walkable in both directions, which is the second escalator in this project its
# grid has been wrong about -- every route it plans out of the south goes back up
# the down one. The pickups need the player within about ten pixels: passing at
# (1057,1032) with the object at (1046,1045) collects nothing, and the leg is
# tuned against `--watch 1CE2`, which is slot 11's count and reads `$0020` BCD
# per pickup rather than the 64 a hex reading would give.
#
# What it buys: the census, which was empty. Weapon `$67`'s shots install
# `$81:F6A3` as their collision handler and no input had ever fired one --
# **273 declines**, and the routine behind them is seventeen bytes.
#
# What it does not buy is the kill. The boss takes 70 -> 66 -> 62 -> 58 -> 54,
# four hits out of forty shots, and `boss_died` is still untaken. Six attempts
# are recorded in docs/cosim.md; the useful measurement is that standing still
# and firing one way lands **nothing at all**, four times out of four.
#
# Retune by watching the health word, on the page the record dump gives:
#   zamn_headless <rom> shot.png 6700 -m movies\level25-heavy.zmv --watch 083C
#   zamn_headless <rom> shot.png 6700 -m movies\level25-heavy.zmv --records 3890,3890,1
